*'''TRUSTED''': Flag if the OS-Application is Trusted or not. BE AWARE TO REDUCE TO MINIMUM THE USE OF TRUSTED OS-APPLICATIONS, BECAUSE THEY BYPASS MEMORY PROTECTION (if enabled).
